# Frontend (Next.js + shadcn)

## Patterns

- App Router under `kiosk_frontend/app`
- Data fetching: React Query for client lists; server helpers when already used
- Forms: react-hook-form + zod where the file already uses them
- Styling: Tailwind + `cn()` from `lib/utils`
- State: Zustand stores in `lib/store`

## UI system

- Use shadcn components from `@/components/ui/*` for new UI (Button, Input, Card, Dialog, Sheet, Table, Select, Tabs, AlertDialog, …)
- Add missing primitives with: `npx shadcn@latest add <name>` (style: `new-york`, `cssVariables: true`, RTL on)
- Theme tokens live in `app/globals.css` (`--primary`, `--background`, …). Keep brand orange/cream; do not reset to neutral/black defaults
- Icons: `lucide-react`
- Prefer logical CSS (`ms`/`me`/`ps`/`pe`, `start`/`end`) for RTL
- Touch-friendly targets on customer kiosk; large screens use `2k` / `4k` breakpoints
- Existing `components/shared` and admin managers: keep working; prefer shadcn when touching UI heavily

## API

- Call backend only through `lib/api/*`
- Browser base URL: `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL` (often `/api` behind nginx)
- Server-side: `getServerApiBaseUrl()` from `lib/api/base-url.ts`

## Agent tooling

- Live UI checks: Browser MCP or Playwright against the running Next app
- Library docs (Next, Tailwind, shadcn, React Query): Context7
